{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xmlns:th=\"http://www.thymeleaf.org\" lang=\"cs\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title th:text=\"${documentTitle}\">Potvrzení o přijetí daru</title>\n    <meta name=\"author\" th:content=\"${foundationName}\" />\n    <style>\n        @page {\n            size: A4;\n            margin: 15mm 18mm 20mm 18mm;\n            @bottom-center {\n                content: element(footer);\n                vertical-align: top;\n            }\n            @bottom-right {\n                content: counter(page) \" / \" counter(pages);\n                font-family: 'DejaVu Sans';\n                font-size: 7.5pt;\n                color: #555555;\n                vertical-align: top;\n                padding-top: 4mm;\n            }\n        }\n        body {\n            font-family: 'DejaVu Sans';\n            font-size: 9.5pt;\n            line-height: 1.3;\n            color: #1f2328;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n        .footer {\n            position: running(footer);\n            font-size: 7.5pt;\n            color: #555555;\n            padding-top: 4mm;\n            border-top: 0.5pt solid #b8bec6;\n        }\n        table {\n            -fs-table-paginate: paginate;\n            border-collapse: collapse;\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n        thead {\n            display: table-header-group;\n        }\n        tr {\n            page-break-inside: avoid;\n        }\n        td, th {\n            vertical-align: top;\n            padding: 0;\n        }\n        p {\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n        .header td.logo {\n            width: 60mm;\n        }\n        .header td.logo img {\n            width: 58mm;\n        }\n        .header td.title {\n            text-align: right;\n        }\n        h1 {\n            font-size: 13pt;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin: 0 0 1.5mm 0;\n        }\n        h2 {\n            font-size: 10.5pt;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            margin: 0 0 1.5mm 0;\n            padding-bottom: 1mm;\n            border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #b8bec6;\n        }\n        .en {\n            font-size: 7.5pt;\n            color: #6b7280;\n        }\n        h1 .en, h2 .en {\n            font-weight: 400;\n        }\n        .replaces {\n            margin-top: 5mm;\n            padding: 3mm;\n            background-color: #fdf1e3;\n            border: 0.75pt solid #e0a458;\n            font-weight: 700;\n        }\n        .replaces .en {\n            font-weight: 400;\n        }\n        .section {\n            margin-top: 4mm;\n        }\n        .parties td.party {\n            width: 50%;\n        }\n        .parties td.party.donee {\n            padding-right: 6mm;\n        }\n        .line {\n            margin-bottom: 1mm;\n        }\n        .gifts {\n            margin-top: 2mm;\n        }\n        .gifts th {\n            font-weight: 700;\n            text-align: left;\n            padding: 1.5mm 2mm;\n            border-bottom: 0.75pt solid #1f2328;\n            background-color: #f1f3f5;\n        }\n        .gifts td {\n            padding: 1.2mm 2mm;\n            border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #dde1e6;\n        }\n        .gifts .amount {\n            text-align: right;\n        }\n        .totals {\n            margin-top: 2mm;\n        }\n        .totals .total {\n            font-weight: 700;\n        }\n        .closing {\n            page-break-inside: avoid;\n        }\n        .declaration p.en {\n            margin-top: 1.5mm;\n        }\n        .signature {\n            margin-top: 6mm;\n            page-break-inside: avoid;\n        }\n        .signature .image {\n            height: 18mm;\n            margin-top: 1mm;\n        }\n        .signature .image img {\n            max-height: 18mm;\n            max-width: 60mm;\n        }\n        .signature .blank {\n            height: 12mm;\n        }\n        .signature .rule {\n            width: 70mm;\n            border-top: 0.5pt solid #1f2328;\n            padding-top: 1mm;\n        }\n        .signature .name {\n            font-weight: 700;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"footer\" th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.footer', foundationName, foundationIdentifier, foundationAddress, number)}\">footer</div>\n\n<table class=\"header\">\n    <tr>\n        <td class=\"logo\"><img th:src=\"${logo}\" th:alt=\"${foundationName}\" alt=\"\" /></td>\n        <td class=\"title\">\n            <h1>\n                <span th:text=\"${single} ? ${cs.text('receipt.title.single')} : ${cs.text('receipt.title.yearly', year)}\">Potvrzení</span>\n                <br th:if=\"${bilingual}\" />\n                <span class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\"\n                      th:text=\"${single} ? ${en.text('receipt.title.single')} : ${en.text('receipt.title.yearly', year)}\">Confirmation</span>\n            </h1>\n            <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.number', number)}\">Číslo potvrzení</p>\n            <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.number', number)}\">Confirmation No.</p>\n            <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.issuedOn', issuedOnCs)}\">Datum vystavení</p>\n            <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.issuedOn', issuedOnEn)}\">Date of issue</p>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"replaces\" th:if=\"${replaced}\">\n    <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.replaces', replacedNumber, replacedOnCs)}\">Toto potvrzení nahrazuje</p>\n    <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.replaces', replacedNumber, replacedOnEn)}\">This confirmation replaces</p>\n</div>\n\n<table class=\"section parties\">\n    <tr>\n        <td class=\"party donee\">\n            <h2>\n                <span th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.donee')}\">Obdarovaný</span>\n                <span class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${'/ ' + en.text('receipt.donee')}\">Donee</span>\n            </h2>\n            <div class=\"line\">\n                <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.donee.name', foundationName)}\">Název</p>\n                <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.donee.name', foundationName)}\">Name</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"line\">\n                <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.donee.companyIdentifier', foundationIdentifier)}\">IČO</p>\n                <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.donee.companyIdentifier', foundationIdentifier)}\">Company ID</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"line\">\n                <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.donee.seat', foundationAddress)}\">Sídlo</p>\n                <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.donee.seat', foundationAddress)}\">Registered office</p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"line\">\n                <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.donee.registry', registryFile, registryCourt)}\">zapsaný v nadačním rejstříku</p>\n                <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.donee.registry', registryFile, registryCourt)}\">registered</p>\n            </div>\n        </td>\n        <td class=\"party donor\">\n            <h2>\n                <span th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.donor')}\">Dárce</span>\n                <span class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${'/ ' + en.text('receipt.donor')}\">Donor</span>\n            </h2>\n            <th:block th:if=\"${company}\">\n                <div class=\"line\">\n                    <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.donor.company.name', donorName)}\">Název</p>\n                    <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.donor.company.name', donorName)}\">Name</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"line\">\n                    <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.donor.company.identifier', donorIdentifier)}\">IČO</p>\n                    <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.donor.company.identifier', donorIdentifier)}\">Company ID</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"line\">\n                    <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.donor.company.seat', donorAddress)}\">Sídlo</p>\n                    <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.donor.company.seat', donorAddress)}\">Registered office</p>\n                </div>\n            </th:block>\n            <th:block th:unless=\"${company}\">\n                <div class=\"line\">\n                    <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.donor.person.name', donorName)}\">Jméno a příjmení</p>\n                    <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.donor.person.name', donorName)}\">Name and surname</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"line\">\n                    <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.donor.person.residence', donorAddress)}\">Bydliště</p>\n                    <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.donor.person.residence', donorAddress)}\">Residence</p>\n                </div>\n            </th:block>\n            <div class=\"line\">\n                <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.donor.variableSymbol', variableSymbol)}\">Variabilní symbol</p>\n                <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.donor.variableSymbol', variableSymbol)}\">Variable symbol</p>\n            </div>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"section gift\" th:if=\"${single}\">\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        <p th:text=\"${cs.text(giftFormKey)}\">Forma daru</p>\n        <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text(giftFormKey)}\">Form of the gift</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.gift.receivedOn', receivedOnCs)}\">Datum připsání na účet</p>\n        <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.gift.receivedOn', receivedOnEn)}\">Date credited</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.gift.amount', totalCs)}\">Částka</p>\n        <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.gift.amount', totalEn)}\">Amount</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.gift.account', accountNumber)}\">Účet příjemce</p>\n        <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.gift.account', accountNumber)}\">Recipient account</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section gifts-yearly\" th:unless=\"${single}\">\n    <div class=\"line\">\n        <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.gift.account', accountNumber)}\">Účet příjemce</p>\n        <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.gift.account', accountNumber)}\">Recipient account</p>\n    </div>\n    <table class=\"gifts\">\n        <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>\n                <span th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.table.receivedOn')}\">Datum připsání na účet</span>\n                <br th:if=\"${bilingual}\" />\n                <span class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.table.receivedOn')}\">Date credited</span>\n            </th>\n            <th class=\"amount\">\n                <span th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.table.amount')}\">Částka</span>\n                <br th:if=\"${bilingual}\" />\n                <span class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.table.amount')}\">Amount</span>\n            </th>\n        </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n        <tr th:each=\"line : ${lines}\">\n            <td>\n                <span th:text=\"${line['receivedOnCs']}\">1. 1. 2026</span>\n                <span class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${'(' + line['receivedOnEn'] + ')'}\">(1 January 2026)</span>\n            </td>\n            <td class=\"amount\">\n                <span th:text=\"${line['amountCs']}\">500 Kč</span>\n                <span class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${'(' + line['amountEn'] + ')'}\">(CZK 500)</span>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n    <div class=\"totals\">\n        <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.yearly.count', count)}\">Počet darů</p>\n        <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.yearly.count', count)}\">Number of gifts</p>\n        <p class=\"total\" th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.yearly.total', year, totalCs)}\">Celkem darováno</p>\n        <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.yearly.total', year, totalEn)}\">Total donated</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section closing\">\n<div class=\"declaration\">\n    <p th:text=\"${single} ? ${cs.text('receipt.declaration.single', foundationName, receivedOnCs, totalCs, accountNumber)} : ${cs.text('receipt.declaration.yearly', foundationName, year, totalCs, accountNumber)}\">Prohlášení</p>\n    <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\"\n       th:text=\"${single} ? ${en.text('receipt.declaration.single', foundationName, receivedOnEn, totalEn, accountNumber)} : ${en.text('receipt.declaration.yearly', foundationName, year, totalEn, accountNumber)}\">Declaration</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"signature\">\n    <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.issuedAt', issuePlace, issuedOnCs)}\">V Novém Boru dne</p>\n    <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.issuedAt', issuePlaceEn, issuedOnEn)}\">In Nový Bor, on</p>\n    <p th:text=\"${cs.text('receipt.signature.for', foundationName)}\">Za</p>\n    <p class=\"en\" th:if=\"${bilingual}\" th:text=\"${en.text('receipt.signature.for', foundationName)}\">For</p>\n    <div class=\"image\" th:if=\"${signature != null}\"><img th:src=\"${signature}\" alt=\"\" /></div>\n    <div class=\"blank\" th:if=\"${signature == null}\"></div>\n    <div class=\"rule\">\n        <p class=\"name\" th:text=\"${signatoryName}\">Jméno</p>\n        <p th:text=\"${signatoryRole}\">Funkce</p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>\n","texts":{"cs":{"receipt.declaration.single":"{0} potvrzuje, že od výše uvedeného dárce přijal dne {1} peněžitý dar ve výši {2}, poukázaný bankovním převodem na účet nadačního fondu č. {3}. Dar byl poskytnut bezúplatně a bez jakéhokoli protiplnění na účely sociální, zdravotnické, charitativní a na podporu a ochranu mládeže ve smyslu § 15 odst. 1 a § 20 odst. 8 zákona č. 586/1992 Sb., o daních z příjmů, ve znění pozdějších předpisů, a to v souladu s účelem nadačního fondu. Potvrzení se vydává na žádost dárce pro účely uplatnění odpočtu hodnoty daru od základu daně podle § 15 odst. 1 (poplatník daně z příjmů fyzických osob) nebo § 20 odst. 8 (poplatník daně z příjmů právnických osob) uvedeného zákona.","receipt.declaration.yearly":"{0} potvrzuje, že od výše uvedeného dárce přijal v roce {1} peněžité dary uvedené v tomto potvrzení v celkové výši {2}, poukázané bankovním převodem na účet nadačního fondu č. {3}. Dary byly poskytnuty bezúplatně a bez jakéhokoli protiplnění na účely sociální, zdravotnické, charitativní a na podporu a ochranu mládeže ve smyslu § 15 odst. 1 a § 20 odst. 8 zákona č. 586/1992 Sb., o daních z příjmů, ve znění pozdějších předpisů, a to v souladu s účelem nadačního fondu. Potvrzení se vydává na žádost dárce pro účely uplatnění odpočtu hodnoty darů od základu daně podle § 15 odst. 1 (poplatník daně z příjmů fyzických osob) nebo § 20 odst. 8 (poplatník daně z příjmů právnických osob) uvedeného zákona.","receipt.donee":"Obdarovaný","receipt.donee.companyIdentifier":"IČO: {0}","receipt.donee.name":"Název: {0}","receipt.donee.registry":"zapsaný v nadačním rejstříku, spisová značka {0}, rejstříkový soud: {1}","receipt.donee.seat":"Sídlo: {0}","receipt.donor":"Dárce","receipt.donor.company.identifier":"IČO: {0}","receipt.donor.company.name":"Název: {0}","receipt.donor.company.seat":"Sídlo: {0}","receipt.donor.person.name":"Jméno a příjmení: {0}","receipt.donor.person.residence":"Bydliště: {0}","receipt.donor.variableSymbol":"Variabilní symbol: {0}","receipt.footer":"{0} · IČO {1} · {2} · Číslo potvrzení: {3}","receipt.gift.account":"Účet příjemce: {0}","receipt.gift.amount":"Částka: {0}","receipt.gift.form.BANK_TRANSFER":"Forma daru: peněžitý dar, bankovní převod","receipt.gift.form.MANUAL":"Forma daru: peněžitý dar","receipt.gift.receivedOn":"Datum připsání na účet: {0}","receipt.issuedAt":"{0} dne {1}","receipt.issuedOn":"Datum vystavení: {0}","receipt.number":"Číslo potvrzení: {0}","receipt.replaces":"Toto potvrzení nahrazuje potvrzení č. {0} ze dne {1}, které tímto pozbývá platnosti.","receipt.signature.for":"Za {0}:","receipt.table.amount":"Částka","receipt.table.receivedOn":"Datum připsání na účet","receipt.title.single":"Potvrzení o přijetí daru","receipt.title.yearly":"Potvrzení o přijatých darech za rok {0}","receipt.yearly.count":"Počet darů: {0}","receipt.yearly.total":"Celkem darováno v roce {0}: {1}"},"en":{"receipt.declaration.single":"{0} confirms that on {1} it received from the above donor a monetary gift of {2}, transferred by bank transfer to the account of the foundation No. {3}. The gift was given free of charge and without any consideration for social, health and charitable purposes and for the support and protection of youth within the meaning of § 15 odst. 1 and § 20 odst. 8 of zákon č. 586/1992 Sb., o daních z příjmů (Section 15(1) and Section 20(8) of Act No. 586/1992 Coll., on Income Taxes), as amended, in accordance with the purpose of the foundation. This confirmation is issued at the request of the donor for the purpose of deducting the value of the gift from the tax base under Section 15(1) (individual income taxpayer) or Section 20(8) (corporate income taxpayer) of that Act.","receipt.declaration.yearly":"{0} confirms that in {1} it received from the above donor the monetary gifts listed in this confirmation totalling {2}, transferred by bank transfer to the account of the foundation No. {3}. The gifts were given free of charge and without any consideration for social, health and charitable purposes and for the support and protection of youth within the meaning of § 15 odst. 1 and § 20 odst. 8 of zákon č. 586/1992 Sb., o daních z příjmů (Section 15(1) and Section 20(8) of Act No. 586/1992 Coll., on Income Taxes), as amended, in accordance with the purpose of the foundation. This confirmation is issued at the request of the donor for the purpose of deducting the value of the gifts from the tax base under Section 15(1) (individual income taxpayer) or Section 20(8) (corporate income taxpayer) of that Act.","receipt.donee":"Donee","receipt.donee.companyIdentifier":"Company ID: {0}","receipt.donee.name":"Name: {0}","receipt.donee.registry":"registered in the Register of Foundations, file No. {0}, registry court: {1}","receipt.donee.seat":"Registered office: {0}","receipt.donor":"Donor","receipt.donor.company.identifier":"Company ID: {0}","receipt.donor.company.name":"Name: {0}","receipt.donor.company.seat":"Registered office: {0}","receipt.donor.person.name":"Name and surname: {0}","receipt.donor.person.residence":"Residence: {0}","receipt.donor.variableSymbol":"Variable symbol: {0}","receipt.footer":"{0} · Company ID {1} · {2} · Confirmation No.: {3}","receipt.gift.account":"Recipient account: {0}","receipt.gift.amount":"Amount: {0}","receipt.gift.form.BANK_TRANSFER":"Form of the gift: monetary gift, bank transfer","receipt.gift.form.MANUAL":"Form of the gift: monetary gift","receipt.gift.receivedOn":"Date credited to the account: {0}","receipt.issuedAt":"In {0}, on {1}","receipt.issuedOn":"Date of issue: {0}","receipt.number":"Confirmation No.: {0}","receipt.replaces":"This confirmation replaces confirmation No. {0} of {1}, which is hereby void.","receipt.signature.for":"For {0}:","receipt.table.amount":"Amount","receipt.table.receivedOn":"Date credited to the account","receipt.title.single":"Confirmation of a donation received","receipt.title.yearly":"Confirmation of donations received in {0}","receipt.yearly.count":"Number of gifts: {0}","receipt.yearly.total":"Total donated in {0}: {1}"}}}